## Description

Tried recreating Fall Guys using the exact same prompt with Claude Opus 5.0 (Claude Code) and Kimi K3 (Kimi CLI).  Kimi K3 nailed the gameplay out of the box. Physics, movement, and the overall feel were surprisingly solid  Opus 5.0 had a shinier UI, but movement was broken, it https://t.co/0qC3ownQzM

